// BESSER's none (besser/instances/none.py) in the Exam DSL: 3-clique with no weights.
// 7-none.exam solved by QAOA instead: keep the two files' problems identical.
// Four exams that all conflict, three batches. No schedule places them all: one exam is left
// unscheduled, at cost 1 (ADR-0009), where BESSER's formulation accepts one conflict instead.
problem none_qaoa batches 3
students Ana Rui Eva
exam Algebra    { Ana Rui Eva }
exam Calculus   { Ana Rui Eva }
exam Physics    { Ana Rui Eva }
exam Statistics { Ana Rui Eva }

solver { method QAOA depth 2 optimizer COBYLA iterations 150 shots 4096 seed 7 }
